{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21195","headline":"刘氏馆集隐客归和子元及之子蒙晦之 · 元稹","name":"刘氏馆集隐客归和子元及之子蒙晦之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湿垫缘竹径，寥落护岸冰。\n偶然沽市酒，不越四五升。\n诗客爱时景，道人话升腾。\n笑言各有趣，悠哉古孙登。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21195.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21195","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}